  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interpeace Somalia Programme - Interpeace Peace Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Interpeace fredsprogram</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interpeace Somali Programme has two components: Pillars of Peace and democratization. Hence the two components have separete but connected visions. 

The vision of Pillars of Peace is to build social cohesion and goodwill in the societies of Somaliland, Puntland and south central Somalia by providing a peacebuilding perspective to nuance and underpin the ongoing statebuilding processes taking place in these regions. 

The vision of the Democratisation programme is to realise a stronger and more stable Somali Region by supporting a peaceful and locally-owned process of democratisation in Somaliland and Puntland.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Interpeace fredsbyggnad- och demokratiseringsprogram Denna  andra fasen av Pillars of Peace kommer att genomf&#xf6;ra de               rekommendationer och slutsatser fr&#xe5;n programmets f&#xf6;rsta fas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Interpeace peace-building and                          democratizationprogramme. This is the second phase of the Pillars of  Peace, which will implement the recommendations outlined by the first phase.</narrative>
  </description>
